{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45631","headline":"冬末病中作二首 一 · 贯休","name":"冬末病中作二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬风吹草木，亦吹我病根。\n故人久不来，冷落如丘园。\n聃龙与摩诘，吁叹非不闻。\n顾惟年少时，未合多忧懃。\n风锺远孤枕，雪水流冻痕。\n空余微妙心，期空静者论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}